{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0034_1000_014mir", "source_sha256": "bc72cffc742bc77b34fc5c1e0792393901335017f606bde0b3304e47a69df858", "ja": "{$P$}さんっ！　今日のライブ、\nすっごく、すーっごく盛り上がりましたね！", "zh": "{$P$}先生！今天的演唱会\n气氛超级超～级热烈呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0034_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "9654908f8ca3b8b3986ad67643a578ea59c8c82926d9183c9a5a7adc1fcfc56a", "ja": "あー、楽しかった♪\nなんていうか、夢みたいでした！", "zh": "啊～真开心♪\n总觉得好像在作梦一样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0034_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "4dc2309bdb475fc462c7416409d9f803802b4f072879a9500ea1b8946b495d57", "ja": "私の曲の時にみんなが振ってくれた、あの赤みたいな\nピンクみたいな棒、すごく綺麗だったなー♪", "zh": "在我唱歌时大家为我挥舞的，那些像红色\n又像粉红色的棒子，真的好漂亮啊～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0034_1003_p", "source_sha256": "99338d95291585a1b7b5802543af8f453426104dfa36f33ecacbddb956e5bb2e", "ja": "コンサートライトのことか？\n確かに、すごく綺麗だったな。", "zh": "你是说萤光棒吗？\n确实相当漂亮呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0034_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "7fe4bc2f043a482060490c3a918fe2a645f9f526679bcb5ac4a9c0ab772f10c9", "ja": "それです！　ライトの光を見てたら、私、\nなんだかすっごく感動してきちゃって……。", "zh": "就是那个！看着萤光棒的光，\n我突然觉得很感动……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0034_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "f02e965babf0b41571bba8f6cd22dd4dd1d38910d6a6e3a3b8b924824447757b", "ja": "私のこと応援してくれる人が、\nこんなにいるんだーって。えへへ……♪", "zh": "原来愿意支持我的人\n有这么多呢～嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0034_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "4a86a82171468ce1cc34e411de1185079edc4b1b8b0e0759e5a7574ae1707a40", "ja": "今日はたくさん応援してもらったから、私も\nファンのみんなのこと、元気にしてあげたいです！", "zh": "今天获得了好多声援，\n所以我也想把活力带给粉丝们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0034_1007_p", "source_sha256": "1b3ffe24f5ef094a8d82347782b8559e5eae5a6b07badac90601043ee8d744a4", "ja": "そうだな。\nこれからたくさん返せると思うよ。", "zh": "是啊。\n我想今后你还有很多机会能回报大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0034_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "36b9e014ff6f63ce5ed7ad25bba9161a3ef1e10fb9e36d8aa8bef52d6c9e8cea", "ja": "あ……そうだっ！　今度のライブ、\n私もコンサートライトを持っていっていいですか？", "zh": "啊……对了！下次演唱会，\n我也可以拿萤光棒上台吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0034_1009_p", "source_sha256": "0bedb5884879476dbcacf7d7d376aa237a62a0dc902600ef307ef3e550bcec65", "ja": "未来が？　それはそれで面白そうだけど、\nうっかり放り投げそうで怖いな……。", "zh": "未来要拿吗？要说有趣的确是满有趣的，\n但感觉会不小心丢出去，有点可怕呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0034_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "057082c4ca62bd1c58bbafcc5a10977dc1fe957dce90cc89507aa1d374e074b5", "ja": "あっ……たしかに、そうかも……。\nでへへ……♪", "zh": "啊……好像是这样没错……\n嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0034_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "0c6f5111dd9e47e36a59a188ed3c0817ad667adece423f420ad313a2d9da3310", "ja": "……やっぱり、いつもどおりがいいですね！\n歌とダンスを頑張って、みんなを盛り上げますっ！", "zh": "……果然还是跟平常一样最好吧！\n我会努力用歌曲和舞蹈，把气氛炒热到最高点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
